# Xero / JMS Export Contract

Every export line must preserve:

| Field | Required |
|---|---|
| Line description | ✅ |
| Quantity | ✅ |
| Unit price / rate | ✅ |
| Account code | ✅ |
| Tax code | ✅ |
| Item code / source mapping | ✅ |
| `needs_review` / defaulted warning | ✅ |

## Hours are quantities in export

Labour lines export as **quantity = hours, rate = hourly rate**. Never convert an hour count into a dollar amount.

```
// ❌ BAD — 7 hours becomes $7 line price
{ description: "Remove edging", quantity: 1, unitAmount: 7 }

// ✅ GOOD — 7 hours × labour rate
{ description: "Remove edging", quantity: 7, unitAmount: labourRate }
```

## Do not suppress warnings on export

Lines with `needs_review: true` or missing account/tax codes must be exported with a warning flag, not silently defaulted or dropped.
